      "releaseNotes": "CarPlay just got a major upgrade! :car:\nYou can now:\n• Search for places from your car\n• Open recent searches and favorites\n• See lane guidance and speed limits\n• View your current speed\n• Pan and zoom the map\n• Choose faster routes when available\nPlus, smoother navigation and reliability improvements throughout the app.",
